{
  "body_human_readable": "Here are the GDP growth forecasts for 2023 and 2024 for India, China, Brazil, Japan, and the United States, based on the latest World Economic Outlook data:\n\n**India:**\n- 2023: 6.7%\n- 2024: 6.5% (Fiscal year 2023/24 is shown in the 2023 column; calendar year projections for 2024 are 6.5%) [1]\n\n**China:**\n- 2023: 5.2%\n- 2024: 4.8% [1]\n\n**Brazil:**\n- 2023: 2.9%\n- 2024: 2.2% [1]\n\n**Japan:**\n- 2023: 1.5%\n- 2024: -0.2% [1]\n\n**United States:**\n- 2023: 2.5%\n- 2024: 2.1% [1]\n\nThese figures are year-over-year percent changes in real GDP, as presented in the IMF's January 2025 World Economic Outlook update.",
